<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'ww-sa-pdp.css' | asset_url }}">
<style>@font-face{font-family:'Cairo';font-style:normal;font-weight:200 1000;font-display:swap;src:url({{ 'ww-sa-cairo-ar.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');unicode-range:U+0600-06FF,U+0750-077F,U+0870-088E,U+0890-0891,U+0898-08E1,U+08E3-08FF,U+200C-200E,U+2010-2011,U+204F,U+2E41,U+FB50-FDFF,U+FE70-FE74,U+FE76-FEFC}@font-face{font-family:'Cairo';font-style:normal;font-weight:200 1000;font-display:swap;src:url({{ 'ww-sa-cairo-lat.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');unicode-range:U+0000-00FF,U+0131,U+0152-0153,U+02BB-02BC,U+02C6,U+02DA,U+02DC,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+2000-206F,U+20AC,U+2122,U+2191,U+2193,U+2212,U+2215,U+FEFF,U+FFFD}</style>
<div class="ww-sa" dir="rtl" lang="ar">
<section class="section sa" id="sa-day">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h3 class="sa-sub">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h3>
    <ul class="sa-days">
{% if section.blocks.size > 0 %}
{% for block in section.blocks %}
      <li class="sa-day" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{% if block.settings.image != blank %}<span class="sa-ico"><img src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 160 }}" alt="" width="54" height="54" loading="lazy"></span>{% else %}<span class="sa-ico">{%- case forloop.index -%}{% when 1 %}<svg width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="var(--sky)" transform="translate(-3 3)"><rect x="9" y="11" width="30" height="20" rx="2.5"/></g><g stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="11" width="30" height="20" rx="2.5"/><path d="M4 37h40M4 37l3-6h34l3 6"/></g></svg>{% when 2 %}<svg width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="var(--sky)" transform="translate(-3 3)"><path d="M8 20h32v14a6 6 0 01-6 6H14a6 6 0 01-6-6z"/></g><g stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 20h32v14a6 6 0 01-6 6H14a6 6 0 01-6-6z"/><path d="M5 20h38M18 14c0-3 2-3 2-6M26 14c0-3 2-3 2-6M8 26H4M40 26h4"/></g></svg>{% when 3 %}<svg width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="var(--sky)" transform="translate(-3 3)"><path d="M16 41h16l3-14c0-5-4-8-11-8s-11 3-11 8z"/></g><g stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 41h16l3-14c0-5-4-8-11-8s-11 3-11 8z"/><path d="M20 19c0-3 1-4 4-4s4 1 4 4M24 11v4M21 11h6M13 27c-5-1-8-4-9-8M35 25c3 0 6-1 8-4M38 41H10"/></g></svg>{% when 4 %}<svg width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="var(--sky)" transform="translate(-3 3)"><path d="M32 8a17 17 0 100 30 14 14 0 01-12-15A14 14 0 0132 8z"/></g><g stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M32 8a17 17 0 100 30 14 14 0 01-12-15A14 14 0 0132 8z"/><path d="M38 12v6M35 15h6"/></g></svg>{%- else -%}<svg width="54" height="54" viewBox="-8 -8 116 116" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M50 4C54 34 66 46 96 50 66 54 54 66 50 96 46 66 34 54 4 50 34 46 46 34 50 4Z" fill="var(--sky)" stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="4" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>{%- endcase -%}</span>{% endif %}<b>{{ block.settings.title }}</b><p>{{ block.settings.text }}</p></li>
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
      <li class="sa-day"><span class="sa-ico"><svg width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="var(--sky)" transform="translate(-3 3)"><rect x="9" y="11" width="30" height="20" rx="2.5"/></g><g stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="11" width="30" height="20" rx="2.5"/><path d="M4 37h40M4 37l3-6h34l3 6"/></g></svg></span><b>على مكتبك</b><p>الاجتماع شغّال والشاشة قدامك. إيديك على الكيبورد، وجلستك تمشي معك.</p></li>
      <li class="sa-day"><span class="sa-ico"><svg width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="var(--sky)" transform="translate(-3 3)"><path d="M8 20h32v14a6 6 0 01-6 6H14a6 6 0 01-6-6z"/></g><g stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 20h32v14a6 6 0 01-6 6H14a6 6 0 01-6-6z"/><path d="M5 20h38M18 14c0-3 2-3 2-6M26 14c0-3 2-3 2-6M8 26H4M40 26h4"/></g></svg></span><b>في مطبخك</b><p>الغدا على النار والعيال حولك. إيديك للطبخ، والمضخة تشتغل لحالها.</p></li>
      <li class="sa-day"><span class="sa-ico"><svg width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="var(--sky)" transform="translate(-3 3)"><path d="M16 41h16l3-14c0-5-4-8-11-8s-11 3-11 8z"/></g><g stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 41h16l3-14c0-5-4-8-11-8s-11 3-11 8z"/><path d="M20 19c0-3 1-4 4-4s4 1 4 4M24 11v4M21 11h6M13 27c-5-1-8-4-9-8M35 25c3 0 6-1 8-4M38 41H10"/></g></svg></span><b>والضيوف في المجلس</b><p>زيارة النفاس في البيت؟ صبّي القهوة وكمّلي ضيافتك، وجلستك ماشية.</p></li>
      <li class="sa-day"><span class="sa-ico"><svg width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="var(--sky)" transform="translate(-3 3)"><path d="M32 8a17 17 0 100 30 14 14 0 01-12-15A14 14 0 0132 8z"/></g><g stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M32 8a17 17 0 100 30 14 14 0 01-12-15A14 14 0 0132 8z"/><path d="M38 12v6M35 15h6"/></g></svg></span><b>بعد ما ينام البيت</b><p>جلسة هادية بدون أسلاك تتدلّى، وبدون ما تصحين أحد.</p></li>
{% endif %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
</div>
{% schema %}
{
 "name": "WW SA Four day boxes",
 "settings": [
  {"type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "جلستك تمشي مع يومك"}
 ],
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "day",
   "name": "Day box",
   "settings": [
    {"type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title", "default": "عنوان"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "text", "label": "Text", "default": "النص يظهر هنا."},
    {"type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Custom icon (optional)", "info": "Leave empty to use the built-in icon for this position."}
   ]
  }
 ],
 "max_blocks": 8,
 "presets": [
  {
   "name": "WW SA Four day boxes",
   "blocks": [
    {"type": "day", "settings": {"title": "على مكتبك", "text": "الاجتماع شغّال والشاشة قدامك. إيديك على الكيبورد، وجلستك تمشي معك."}},
    {"type": "day", "settings": {"title": "في مطبخك", "text": "الغدا على النار والعيال حولك. إيديك للطبخ، والمضخة تشتغل لحالها."}},
    {"type": "day", "settings": {"title": "والضيوف في المجلس", "text": "زيارة النفاس في البيت؟ صبّي القهوة وكمّلي ضيافتك، وجلستك ماشية."}},
    {"type": "day", "settings": {"title": "بعد ما ينام البيت", "text": "جلسة هادية بدون أسلاك تتدلّى، وبدون ما تصحين أحد."}}
   ]
  }
 ]
}
{% endschema %}
